menu "HID add-on CAF extensions"
	depends on CAF

config CAF_EXTENSION
	bool "HID add-on CAF extensions"
	default y
	help
	  CAF extensions provided by the HID add-on.

	  The HID Add-on temporarily extends CAF until these features are
	  available in the used nRF Connect SDK release. These features are already
	  available in nRF Connect SDK main and ported here for early access.

	  The add-on also provides the CAF Buttons ISR module that
	  reduces click latency for gaming-grade HID devices.

if CAF_EXTENSION

rsource "events/Kconfig"
rsource "modules/Kconfig"

endif # CAF_EXTENSION

endmenu
